Rhombus/HOL library third-party notices
=======================================

This package's original material is under 0BSD. Because it was developed with
coding agents, the package conservatively retains upstream notices even where
the adaptation may concern an algorithm or public interface rather than
copyrightable source expression. This package-level treatment does not assert
that every file derives from every named project.

HOL Light (LICENSES/HOL-Light.txt)
----------------------------------

Covers conv.rhm, drule.rhm, algebra.rhm, infinity.rhm, wfrec.rhm,
treerep.rhm, datatype construction code, and related tests/documentation.
These files adapt HOL Light conversions, derived rules, pair/sum/natural-number
constructions, well-founded recursion, and datatype representation techniques.

HOL4 (LICENSES/HOL4.txt)
------------------------

Covers bool.rhm and related base-logic material, which follows HOL4's logical
constants and ETA, SELECT, and BOOL_CASES axiom selection, and any HOL4-derived
well-founded recursion material.

ACL2 (LICENSES/ACL2.txt)
------------------------

Covers the automatic prover, including waterfall.rhm, goal.rhm, simp.rhm,
destruct.rhm, fertilize.rhm, general.rhm, irrelevance.rhm, induct.rhm,
order.rhm, ruledb.rhm, and ACL2-style hint handling in elab.rhm and driver.rhm,
plus related tests/documentation.

QuickCheck (LICENSES/QuickCheck.txt)
------------------------------------

Covers qc.rhm, datatype generator/shrinker emission in module_block.rhm, and
related tests/documentation.
